{"Title":"An Act relative to Steamship Authority borrowing","BillNumber":"S2225","DocketNumber":"SD437","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JAC0","Name":"Julian Cyr","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAC0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-15T21:57:10.983"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JAC0","Name":"Julian Cyr","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAC0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-15T21:57:10.9833333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2225/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Cyr, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2225) of Julian Cyr for legislation relative to Steamship Authority borrowing.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Paragraph (b) of section 4 of chapter 701 of the acts of 1960 as most recently amended by Section 12 of chapter 79 of the Acts of 2014 is hereby amended by striking out the figure “$100,000,000” and inserting in place thereof the following figure:- \"$150,000,000\". \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}